# Optional — Formspree endpoints for the site's forms (https://formspree.io).
# Without them, each form opens a pre-filled email to the right Nightfall inbox instead.
#
# One Formspree form per inbox:
#   ENQUIRY → admin@nightfallworldwide.com   (contracts, general questions, film briefs)
#   STUDIO  → studio@nightfallworldwide.com  (bookings: sessions, mixes, WhiteWall)
#   UPLOAD  → distribution@nightfallworldwide.com (release uploads)
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_ENQUIRY=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_STUDIO=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_UPLOAD=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx
# Mix & master orders — falls back to STUDIO, then ENQUIRY, when unset.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_MIX=https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx

# Optional — a Spotify app's credentials (free: developer.spotify.com → Dashboard →
# Create app; any name and redirect URI). With them, `npm run releases` matches every
# release in the Latest releases feed to its Spotify page by barcode. Only the sync
# script reads these — they never reach the browser. For the six-hourly sync on
# GitHub, add them as repository secrets with the same names.
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_ID=…
# SPOTIFY_CLIENT_SECRET=…
